# Bothersome Noisemaker: "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, amass Goblins 1." Bot1 casts the Noisemaker, then a
# creature spell (Ornithopter: no Army), then two artifact spells (Mox Jet makes a 0/0 Goblin Army token with one +1/+1
# counter; Mox Sapphire puts a second counter on the same Army, CR 701.47a, so no second token) and plays a land (not a
# cast). Bot2 then casts a noncreature spell of its own: "you cast" leaves the Army alone (CR 603.2).

